  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Riccardo Savioli is a graphic designer based between Milan and Ferrara, working mainly on visual identities, typography and editorial design. He has designed identities for"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "alessi",
      "label": "Alessi,"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "asif",
      "label": "ASIF,"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "alias",
      "label": "Alias"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "skylrk",
      "label": "SKYLRK,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "as well as for exhibitions such as"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "aldo",
      "label": "A.L.D.O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "virgil-abloh-the-codes",
      "label": "Virgil Abloh: The Codes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "His editorial work includes"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "martisor",
      "label": "Mărțișor by Rebeca Margescu,"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "centolire-multitools",
      "label": "Centolire Multitools by Luca A. Caizzi"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and the"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "c41-magazine",
      "label": "redesign of C41 Magazine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "He has also worked on the identities of"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "acerbis",
      "label": "Acerbis"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "american-haiku",
      "label": "American Haiku,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "on the packaging of the"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "alessi-abloh-conversational-objects",
      "label": "Alessi–Abloh Conversational Objects"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and on the"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "ernest-w-baker-calendar-2023",
      "label": "Ernest W. Baker 2023 Calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Among the books he has designed are"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "materia",
      "label": "Matéria by Paloma Bosquê,"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "volume-i-cc-tapis",
      "label": "VOLUME I for cc-tapis"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "identita-oltre-il-tempo",
      "label": "Identità oltre il tempo by Cecilia Rabeschi and Silvia Palmi."
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "luca-a-caizzi-archive-system",
      "label": "He developed the Luca A. Caizzi Archive System,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "designed the"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "radar-ep-antimonio",
      "label": "Radar EP for Antimonio"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and worked on garments for"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "giacomo-moor-studio",
      "label": "Giacomo Moor Studio"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "project",
      "slug": "quadro-design",
      "label": "Quadro Design."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "In 2026 he’ve been a consultant for Moncler."
